# FesDistribution — Project Standards

This Flutter project is a clone of **Peinture distribution**. Follow the docs and reference source strictly.

## Required reading (before structural or feature work)

1. `docs/architecture.md` — folder layout, layers, one service per entity
2. `docs/database-design.md` — tables, relationships, enums, document flows
3. `docs/flutter-setup.md` — Flutter dependencies, Drift setup, bootstrap, roadmap

If code conflicts with these docs, **update code to match the docs** (or propose a doc update with clear reason).

